8
00:00:43.563 --> 00:00:45.853
Now this function has to be done.

9
00:00:48.047 --> 00:00:53.095
For the girls who are to be married, will you please get up and come round here.

10
00:00:53.387 --> 00:00:56.668
The girls who are to be married, all the girls

11
00:01:40.263 --> 00:01:45.580
