Go go go all of you, just bring a nice big towel, so that you cover yourself. All these clothes have to be taken,

26
00:04:33.100 --> 00:04:35.984
I am sorry, you have to be in your birthday suits.

27
00:04:41.933 --> 00:04:45.399
This has a very secret thing you see

28
00:04:45.630 --> 00:04:51.150
If the boy is suffering from any disease or anything you can see on the skin of the boy

29
